  "Description":      "Entity Face Description, the instance that describes the expression of the face: gives the Face Descriptors Object of a Face Object (a picture of one face). The descriptors are the ten numbers that the HSEmotion model reads from the face: the probabilities of the eight emotions of AffectNet, then the valence and the arousal; the Qualifier of the Object names the format. PS-Face Interpretation turns them into the Face Personal Status. The instance I01 describes the identity of the face (ArcFace), not the expression.",

